@FitnessCalculationService_HostAddress = http://localhost:5122
@authToken = eyJhbGciOiJSUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.e30.placeholder
@userId = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

### 0. Service Health Check
GET {{FitnessCalculationService_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

###

### 1. Submit Fitness Stats (Record Physical Biometrics)
POST {{FitnessCalculationService_HostAddress}}/api/v1/fitness/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "{{userId}}",
  "weight": 80.0,
  "height": 180.0,
  "age": 28,
  "gender": "Male",
  "goal": "Lose Weight",
  "activityLevel": "Moderate",
  "recordedBy": "user"
}

###

### 2. Submit Weight Goal Activity (Onboarding Alias)
POST {{FitnessCalculationService_HostAddress}}/api/v1/fitness/weight-goal-activity
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "{{userId}}",
  "weight": 75.5,
  "height": 178.0,
  "age": 30,
  "gender": "Female",
  "goal": "Maintain Weight",
  "activityLevel": "Light",
  "recordedBy": "user"
}

###

### 3. Get Latest Fitness Stats Snapshot
GET {{FitnessCalculationService_HostAddress}}/api/v1/fitness/stats/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 4. Calculate Metabolic Metrics
POST {{FitnessCalculationService_HostAddress}}/api/v1/fitness/calculate
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "{{userId}}"
}

###

### 5. Get Calculated Metabolic Metrics (Cached in Redis)
GET {{FitnessCalculationService_HostAddress}}/api/v1/fitness/metrics/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 6. Assign Matching Workout Plan
POST {{FitnessCalculationService_HostAddress}}/api/v1/fitness/assign-plan
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "{{userId}}",
  "reason": "Initial program onboarding assignment"
}

###

### 7. Recalculate Metrics (Weight Shift or Biometric Update)
PUT {{FitnessCalculationService_HostAddress}}/api/v1/fitness/recalculate/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "newWeight": 77.5,
  "reason": "Weekly weigh-in check-in"
}

###

### 8. List Plan Configurations (Filtered & Paginated)
GET {{FitnessCalculationService_HostAddress}}/api/v1/fitness/plan-configs?goal=Lose%20Weight&status=Normal&page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 9. Get Plan Configuration by PlanId (Cached in Redis)
GET {{FitnessCalculationService_HostAddress}}/api/v1/fitness/plans/LW-N
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 10. Get Active Workout Plan for User
GET {{FitnessCalculationService_HostAddress}}/api/v1/fitness/plans/active/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 11. Get Plan Assignment History
GET {{FitnessCalculationService_HostAddress}}/api/v1/fitness/plan-history/{{userId}}?page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

###
